  "description": "A lightweight, extensible .NET 9 library implementing the Repository and Unit of Work patterns using Entity Framework Core.\n\t\t\tThis package provides generic repository interfaces and base classes, a repository factory for dependency injection, and a unit of work for transactional consistency.\n\t\t\tDesigned for clean separation of data access logic, it supports CRUD operations for any entity type and promotes maintainable, testable code architecture.",
